              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.2.1+ZEC.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Saka 2:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo bampeela itete ilyapala inkonto iyakupiminako ifintu. Banjeba abati, “Kabiye upime itempele lyakwa Lesa no bulambo, upende na bantu abapepamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.21.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 21:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ulubansa lwa kunse ye tempele lwena ulushe, wilupima. Pantu ulu lubansa lwena balupeela ku Benafyalo, pakuti baleyendelafye abene mu musumba wamushilo pa myeshi amakumi yane na ibili (42). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba nkapeela bakambone bandi babili amaka, kabili bakalasesema amashiwi yakwa Lesa pa nshiku ikana limo ne myanda ibili na makumi mutanda (1,260), bakesa nabafwala insalu shabulanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
